meta {
  name: 18. HIU consent notify (GRANTED)
  type: http
  seq: 18
}

post {
  url: {{careUrl}}/api/abdm/api/v3/hiu/consent/request/notify
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Authorization: Bearer {{callbackToken}}
  REQUEST-ID: {{requestId}}
  TIMESTAMP: {{timestamp}}
  X-HIU-ID: {{hipId}}
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "notification": {
      "consentRequestId": "{{consentRequestId}}",
      "status": "GRANTED",
      "reason": null,
      "consentArtefacts": [ { "id": "{{consentId}}" } ]
    }
  }
}

docs {
  M3 journey 2: the patient decided. GRANTED carries the artefact ids; DENIED and EXPIRED carry none;
  REVOKED names the revoked artefact ids. Operation id `m3-hiu-consent-notify`. The plug acks with
  `consent/v3/request/hiu/on-notify` and, for GRANTED, sends `consent/v3/fetch` per artefact. Body: .../05.
}
